              "correctValue": 52,
              "tolerance": 1,
              "unit": "%",
              "explanation": "0.275 ÷ 0.529 = 0.52, so she retained about 52%. In share count terms: 15,75,000 ÷ 30,34,032 = 51.9%. Three rounds, a pool top-up and anti-dilution shares roughly halved her stake.",
