              "text": "Look at the multiples. The earliest money earned the most, 15.9x for the pre-seed angels. The Series B investor, who bought during the down round at ₹250, earned 3.8x, more than the Series A fund that paid ₹400. The Series C fund, paying the highest price, earned just 1.2x. Entry price matters as much as the company's success.",
